# F1-F17 = (a), O6 (a): no hidden hop, no teleport, no hearthstone rung; OB-00 13.11.2026 (a): the lever has its own key).
# AiPlayerbot.BotGroups.Manager.Gather.Lever (0 = off, default; 1 = on; needs Manager.Gather > 0). Gather stays the measurement
# switch and the arm; the lever acts ONLY with Lever = 1. Pins:
#   (a) the key: member default 0, read once with default 0 right after Gather, an unknown value and Gather 0 each turn it off
#       with one error line, echoed right after BotGroups.Manager.Gather, documented = 0 once with "acts ONLY with Lever = 1";
#   (b) the pure rules: GatherLeverValid (0/1), EffectiveGatherLever (needs Gather), GatherApplies (lever, QUEST only, the
#       Gather arm by the leader's guid), kGatherKindFollow 0, NextRung (walk -> dissolve, hearthstone only when on and useful);
#       NextRung is the one caller of NextFallback; no NextFallback in the manager or the engine;
#   (c) the engine: meetLever decided once at creation; the Enter carries b15 + kind follow only with meetLever (else byte-equal
#       to T30); Decide sees MaskRendezvous only while the meeting is open; the one deadline comes after Decide and ends the
#       group with rendezvous_timeout (no hearthstone, no teleport, no movement in the engine); joins wait while the meeting is
#       open (F13 (a)); the arrival rule only through ArrivedForGroup;
#   (d) the unit tests are registered and run (lever pure/enter/shadow-only/meeting/late/switch-off; minute3 max fits).
# Every check_* returns "" when it holds, else the reason; the negative probes at the end reuse them on mutated text.
